      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)={x}^{2}\\ln(x),$ find ${f}^{\u2032}(x).$\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} $+\\,x$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)=\\ln(x).$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =({x}^{2})^{\u2032}\\ln(x)+{x}^{2}(\\ln(x))^{\u2032} \\\\  & =(2x)(\\ln(x))+{x}^{2}(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =2x\\ln(x)+x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "757adb5b-0925-509b-9649-09ef426906a3",
